  "note": "Election of the whole Cookstown Urban District Council, ordinary day 18 May 1949; twelve nominations for twelve seats, no contest (Mid-Ulster Mail, 7 May 1949, p. 8). 'There will be no contest as there were only 12 nominations for the 12 seats.' Mrs. Glasgow, Mrs. Leeper, Messrs. Bolton and Scott were new members. No party label is printed in this report. Returned unopposed."
